<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>停一下</Text><Box style={{height: 640, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", padding: "0 100px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 500, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.4, textAlign: "center"}}>写，有人管了。跑呢？！</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 28, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.7, textAlign: "center", marginTop: 44, width: 900}}>传统程序有现成环境可以跑；智能体要跑，先得有一个能跑它的 harness。</Text></Box></Box>
